{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-hos-8-1","title":"Hosea 8:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Destruction is threatened both to Israel and Judah for their impiety and idolatry.</p>\n<p>the trumpet. 5:8; Isa 18:3; 58:1; Jer 4:5; 6:1; 51:27; Eze 7:14; 33:3-6; Joe 2:1,15 Am 3:6; Zep 1:16; Zec 9:14; 1Co 15:52 thy mouth. Heb. the roof of thy mouth. as. De 28:49; Jer 4:13; 48:40; Hab 1:8; Mt 24:28 the house. 9:15; 2Ki 18:27; Am 8:3; 9:1; Zec 11:1 transgressed. 6:7; Isa 24:5; Jer 31:32; Eze 16:59; Heb 8:8-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-8-2","title":"Hosea 8:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>5:15; 7:13,14; 2Ki 10:16,29; Ps 78:34-37; Isa 48:1,2; Jer 7:4 Mic 3:11; Mt 7:21; 25:11; Lu 13:25; Tit 1:16; 1Jo 2:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-8-3","title":"Hosea 8:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>cast. Ps 36:3; 81:10,11; Am 1:11; 1Ti 5:12 the enemy. Le 26:36; De 28:25; La 3:66; 4:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-8-4","title":"Hosea 8:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>set. 1Ki 12:16-20; 2Ki 15:10-30 \"Shallum, Menakem, Pekahiah.\" I knew.</p>\n<p>Mt 25:12; Lu 13:25,27; Joh 10:14; Ga 4:9 of. 2:8; 13:2; 1Ki 12:28; 16:31 that they. 13:9; 1Ki 13:34; Jer 44:7,8; Eze 18:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-8-5","title":"Hosea 8:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>calf. 6; 10:5; Isa 45:20; Ac 7:41 mine. De 32:22; 2Ki 17:16-18,21-23 how. Pr 1:22; Jer 4:14; 13:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-8-6","title":"Hosea 8:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>from. Ps 106:19,20 the workman. Ps 115:4-8; 135:15-18; Isa 44:9-20; Jer 10:3-9,14; Hab 2:18 Ac 17:29; 19:26 the calf. 10:2,5,6; Jer 43:12,13; 50:2 shall. 2Ki 23:15,19; 2Ch 31:1; 34:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-8-7","title":"Hosea 8:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>sown. 10:12; Job 4:8; Pr 22:8; Ec 5:16; Ga 6:7 it hath. Isa 17:11; Jer 12:13 stalk. or, standing corn. the strangers. 7:9; De 28:33; Jud 6:3-6; 2Ki 13:3-7; 15:19,29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-8-8","title":"Hosea 8:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>swallowed. 2Ki 17:1-6; 18:11; Jer 50:17; 51:34; La 2:2,5,16; Eze 36:3 among. Le 26:33; De 28:25,64 a vessel. Isa 30:14; Jer 22:28; 48:38; Ro 9:22; 2Ti 2:20,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-8-9","title":"Hosea 8:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>they. 5:13; 7:11; 2Ki 15:19; Eze 23:5-9 a wild. Job 39:5-8; Jer 2:24 hath. 2:5-7,10; 12:1; Isa 30:6; Eze 16:33,34 lovers. Heb. loves.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-8-10","title":"Hosea 8:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>now. 10:10; Eze 16:37; 23:9,10,22-26,46,47 sorrow a little. or, begin to sorrow in a little while, as. Hag 2:6 for. 2Ki 14:26; 15:19,20; 17:3; 1Ch 5:26 the king. Isa 10:8; 36:13; Eze 26:7; Da 2:37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-8-11","title":"Hosea 8:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>many. 10:1,2,8; 12:11; Isa 10:10,11 altars. De 4:28; Jer 16:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-8-12","title":"Hosea 8:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>written. De 4:6-8; Ne 9:13,14; Ps 119:18; 147:19,20; Pr 22:20; Eze 20:11 Ro 3:1; 7:12 but. 4:6; 2Ki 17:15,16; Ne 9:26; Ps 50:17; Isa 30:9; Jer 6:16,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-8-13","title":"Hosea 8:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>They sacrifice, etc. or, In the sacrifices of mine offerings,they sacrifice flesh and eat it. Jer 7:21-23 but. 5:6; 9:4; 12:11; 1Sa 15:22; Pr 21:27; Isa 1:11; Jer 14:10; Am 5:22 1Co 11:20,29 now. 9:9; Ex 20:3; 32:34; Am 8:7; Re 16:19 they shall. 7:16; 9:3,6; 11:5; De 28:68</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-8-14","title":"Hosea 8:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>forgotten. 13:6; De 32:18; Ps 106:21; Isa 17:10; Jer 2:32; 3:21; 23:27 Maker. Isa 29:23; 43:21; Eph 2:10 and buildeth. 1Ki 12:31; 16:31 and Judah. 2Ch 26:10; 27:4; Isa 22:8-11 I will send. 2Ki 18:13; Isa 42:13,25; Jer 17:27; Am 1:4,10,12,14; 2:5</p>"}]}